From cd3a0d3decb543150dd4124944843d6af4340dc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Carlos Cueto <crcueto25@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:53:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] E7: DuDe frees the hole-cut tree of decompose_hole (DP-11)

getCutDiagRoot (holecutconcavity.cpp) builds a candidate tree per cut:
root1 for the cuts on one side, root2 for the other, and moves root2's
children to root1. root2 was never deleted, and decompose_hole never
deleted the returned root (the whole tree). test_dude_reference leaked
528 B on Freiburg52 at tau 20 px; the evaluation maps at tau 20 px leaked
up to 6.7 KB.

Ownership: ~HoleDiagonal deletes its children recursively, and every node
is in exactly one childHoleDiags (insertToRootTree moves a node, the old
parent keeps only the children whose initParent is itself).
tmpChildHoleDiags, initParent and tempParent do not own.

PATCH(dude-7): getCutDiagRoot clears root2's child list (root1 owns them)
and deletes root2 as a node only; decompose_hole deletes the root after
findFeatAndConcavityForComplexHole, its last user (holeDiagVec is local,
draw_decoration.holecutRoot copies only the end points).

test_dude_reference: no leak in the sanitizer build. Golden files
unchanged; the layout matrix gives identical exact dumps in the normal and
the sanitizer build, with no memory error and no leak.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/dude.cpp             | 2 ++
 src/holecutconcavity.cpp | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/dude.cpp b/src/dude.cpp
index 2daac73..fad4a68 100644
--- a/src/dude.cpp
+++ b/src/dude.cpp
@@ -823,6 +823,8 @@ void c_dude::decompose_hole(c_ply &hole, list<ply_vertex *> &tmpholePMs,
 
     findFeatAndConcavityForComplexHole(hole, tmpcutPoints, tmpholePMs,
                                        tmpholeFeatPnts, m_tau, rootcutTmp);
+    delete rootcutTmp; // PATCH(dude-7): the cut tree (~HoleDiagonal frees
+                       // the children; each is in one childHoleDiags)
   }
 }
 
diff --git a/src/holecutconcavity.cpp b/src/holecutconcavity.cpp
index d824336..8e8bf39 100644
--- a/src/holecutconcavity.cpp
+++ b/src/holecutconcavity.cpp
@@ -181,6 +181,8 @@ HoleDiagonal *getCutDiagRoot(const vector<c_diagonal> &holecuts) {
     root1->childHoleDiags.insert(root1->childHoleDiags.end(),
                                  root2->childHoleDiags.begin(),
                                  root2->childHoleDiags.end());
+    root2->childHoleDiags.clear(); // PATCH(dude-7): root1 owns them now;
+    delete root2;                  // root2 itself was never freed
     int tmpD = computeHierarchyDepth(root1);
     if (tmpD < tmpBestDepth) {
       tmpBestDepth = tmpD;
